   <standOff><listPerson><person xml:id="person3765"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">śākyaprabha</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mang du thos pa'i slob dpon shAkya 'od</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shAkya 'od</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">shag kya 'od</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P0AT0383</idno><idno type="APIS">3765</idno></person><person xml:id="person3818"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">བྱ་འདུལ་འཛིན་བརྩོན་འགྲུས་འབར</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul 'dzin</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'dul brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bya 'du ba 'dzin ba brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge bshes zul phu ba</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sangs rgyas bya 'dul 'dzin brtson 'grus 'bar</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zul bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zul phul bya 'dul ba 'dzin pa chen po</persName><birth notBefore="1091-01-01" notAfter="1100-12-31">after 1091 before 1100</birth><death notBefore="1147-01-01" notAfter="1174-12-31">after 1147 before 1174</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2273</idno><idno type="APIS">3818</idno><note type="comment">Born in 1091 at gTsang rong gyung and died at the age of 76 in Zul phu according to [R894SIKE]: 109.&#13;
[W4T5ZMUP]: 38 accordingly proposes the dates 1091-1166.&#13;
[VKBZTBWN], fol. 3b6 reports that he was born the year rNgog lo (ID:3786) came back to Tibet, i.e., ca. 1092.&#13;
On his life, based on the Zul phu mkhan byang chub rin chen dpal bzang po'i rnam par thar pa (ID:6715), see [W4T5ZMUP]: 40.&#13;
It is unclear whether he is the same person as rGya 'dul ba 'dzin pa (ID:4193). The [NA9AMDH6] distinguishes two "rGya 'dul 'dzin" - the elder (ID: 3941) and the younger (ID:4193) - and a "Bya 'dul 'dzin brTson 'grus 'bar" (student of 'Bre chen po). In contrast, the [R894SIKE] only mentions one "rGya 'dul 'dzin" (the elder), distinct from "Bya 'dul 'dzin" (who was ordained by 'Bre).&#13;
[VKBZTBWN], fol. 6b5-6 and [8VLVHDR2], fol. 14b5 report that he was ordained by 'Bre and received from him the name in religion brTson 'grus 'bar.&#13;
A number of the same teachers are mentioned for rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger and Bya 'dul 'dzin but, for instance, the latter's studies with rGya 'dul 'dzin the older took place when he was a retired abbot, whereas the former's studies with him took place when he was still abbot.&#13;
Further, rGya 'dul 'dzin the younger became abbot of dGa' ba sdong and Bya 'dul abbot of Zul phu.&#13;
This suggests they might have been distinct persons.</note></person><person xml:id="person3946"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rtsis pa mkhan po gzhon nu seng ge</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རྩིས་པ་མཁན་པོ་གཞོན་ནུ་སེང་གེ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rtsis pa mkhan po gzhon nu seng+ge</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rtsis 'dul 'dzin gzhon nu seng ge</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gtsang gzhon nu seng ge</persName><birth notBefore="1083-01-01" notAfter="1163-12-31">after 1083 before 1163</birth><death notBefore="1163-01-01" notAfter="1243-12-31">after 1163 before 1243</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P2272</idno><idno type="APIS">3946</idno><note type="comment">The title "rtsis pa mkhan po" indicates he was an astrologer.</note></person><person xml:id="person3969"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rog chos kyi dbang phyug</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རོག་ཆོས་ཀྱི་དབང་ཕྱུག</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bla ma chos kyi dbang phyug</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">byang chub rin chen</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dharmeśvara</persName><birth notBefore="1130-01-01">after 1130</birth><death notBefore="1210-01-01" notAfter="1220-12-31">after 1210 before 1220</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P3065</idno><idno type="APIS">3969</idno><note type="comment">Member of the Rog clan. Abbot of Zul phu (ID:6492) in the 1150s or ca. 1169/70-1220?, after the demise of Bya 'dul 'dzin (ID:3818) ([W4T5ZMUP]: 40).</note></person><person xml:id="person6719"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos kyi byang chub</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཆོས་ཀྱི་བྱང་ཆུབ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">na bza' 'phre gsol</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zul phu ba</persName><birth notBefore="1194-01-01" notAfter="1206-12-31">after 1194 before 1206</birth><death notBefore="1271-01-01" notAfter="1283-12-31">after 1271 before 1283</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">6719</idno><note type="comment">Died when he was 78 ([W4T5ZMUP]: 41.)</note></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3764"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mūlasarvāstivādiśrāmaṇerakārikā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">āryamūlasarvāstivādiśrāmaṇerakārikā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">triśata­kārikā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'phags pa gzhi thams cad yod par smra ba'i dge tshul gyi tshig le'ur byas pa</title><author ref="person:3765">śākyaprabha</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">3764</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4704"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dge tshul rnams kyi tshig le'ur byas pa'i rnam bshad</title><title xml:lang="bo">དགེ་ཚུལ་རྣམས་ཀྱི་ཚིག་ལེའུར་བྱས་པའི་རྣམ་བཤད</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gzhi thams cad yod par smra ba'i dge tshul rnams kyi tshig le'ur byas pa'i rnam par bshad pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshig ler byas pa rin chen 'phreng ba</title><textLang mainLang="bo"/><date type="composition" notBefore="1140-01-01" notAfter="1220-12-31">after 1140  before 1220</date><author ref="person:3969">rog chos kyi dbang phyug</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><relatedItem type="commentaryOn" target="work:3764"/><idno type="APIS">4704</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work4706"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rtsa ba'i lung so sor thar pa'i TIk+ka legs par bkod pa</title><title xml:lang="bo">རྩ་བའི་ལུང་སོ་སོར་ཐར་པའི་ཊཱིཀྐ་ལེགས་པར་བཀོད་པ</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rtsa ba'i lung so sor thar pa'i ti ka legs par bkod pa</title><title type="alt"